sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as Actuator Visualiser
  participant API as FastAPI Backend
  participant MQTT as MQTT Broker
  participant Device as Virtual/Physical Actuator
  UI->>API: Open WebSocket /ws/live?project_id=...
  API-->>UI: Initial actuator state snapshot
  Device->>MQTT: Publish actuator state
  MQTT-->>API: State message
  API-->>UI: WebSocket state update
  UI->>API: POST /command
  API->>MQTT: Publish actuator command
  MQTT-->>Device: Deliver command
